<title>UK: BADMINTON-ALL ENGLAND SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-ALL ENGLAND SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on</p>
<p>semifinals day at the All England badminton championships on</p>
<p>Friday:</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>3/4-Sun Jun (China) beat 9/16-Heryanto Arbi 15-10 15-11</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>3/4-Ye Zhaoying (China) beat Liu Jun (China) 11-1 5-11 11-2</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>1-Ge Fei/Gu Jun (China) beat 5/8-Helene Kirkegaard/Rikke Olsen</p>
<p>15-3 15-6</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>9/16-Dong Jiong (China) beat 1-Poul-Erik Hoyer-Larsen (Denmark) 15-8 15-10</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>2-Gong Zhichao (China) beat Ra Kyung-min (South Korea) 11-2 11-2  </p>
<p>semifinal results:</p>
<p>Men's doubles 5/8 Ha Tae-kwon/Kang Kyung-Jin (South Korea) beat 1-Sigit/Chandra Wijaya (Indonesia) 15-11 15-7 Jon Holst-Christensen/Michael Sogaard (Denmark) beat 2-Cheah Soon Kit/Yap Kim Hock (Malaysia) 15-8 12-15 15-11</p>
<p>Women's doubles 2-Eliza/Resiana Zelin (Indonesia) beat Huang Nanyan/Liu Zhong (China) 15-12 15-8</p>
<p>Mixed doubles 5/8-Liu Yong/Ge Fei (China) beat Chris Hunt/Donna Kellogg (England) 15-6 15-4 1-Trikus Heryanto/Minarti Timur (Indonesia) beat Chen Xingdong/Gu Jun (China) 15-11 12-15 15-2.</p>
</text>
